  "brief": "<!-- sentinel-artifact: v2 -->\n# Project Brief — SYN (synthetic fixture)\n\n## 1. Overview\n\n### 1.1 Identity and Value\n\n- A claims portal lets policyholders file and track insurance claims. [[sources § Source log - SYN # F-01 — supports: x]]\n\n## 3. Product Lens\n\n### 3.2 To-Be Process\n\n- The policyholder signs in with email and password before filing a claim. [[sources § Source log - SYN # F-01 — supports: x]]\n- The policyholder sees the list of claims with their status. [[sources § Source log - SYN # F-01 — supports: x]]\n\n## 6. Release Agreements\n\n### 6.1 In Scope\n\n- Online claim filing. [[sources § Source log - SYN # F-01 — supports: x]]\n\n### 6.2 Out of Scope\n\n- Out of scope: the claims list is a demo only and is not built in this release. [[sources § Source log - SYN # F-01 — supports: x]]\n",
